{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>Et her father.</b> For he is holy — <b>she profanes</b> and degrades him, and her sin is doubled; therefore she is punished by burning." "<b>She profanes.</b> Written with a vav." "<b>In fire she shall be burned.</b> She is executed by burning, but one who lies with her is not executed by burning."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:14:03.697056105Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}